  "description": "Our X-LITE FOUR DISC 105 will make a racer’s heart beat faster. This racing machine has a streamlined frame with amazing aerodynamic values. Its moderate sloping geometry in combination with the vibration-damping Ritchey WCS Flexlogic carbon seatpost with integrated clamp offers a high level of comfort along with an athletic, stretched riding position – ready to push you to your limits! The frame comes with reliable technical features and a mounting point to attach a Dura-Ace power meter. The cockpit is equipped with the Ritchey WCS Evo Curve handlebar. Thanks to an ergonomic top section with a 4-degree backsweep, the drop bar supports a comfortable hand position on the top section. The X-LITE FOUR DISC 105 comes with our lightweight ROSE R Thirty Disc Light wheels and reliable Continental GP 5000 700x25c tyres. Featuring a powerful disc brake, this model offers excellent braking performance in wet conditions and at high speeds, too. Even at full speed, it will bring you to a halt safely. The drivetrain of the X-LITE FOUR DISC 105 is Shimano’s evergreen: fast, precise, reliable and ready to get the best out of you. One bike, no compromises: the new X-LITE FOUR DISC! * approx. 7.5 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for UD carbon/emergency orange frame, size 57 cm, compact, without pedals",
